# Only ignore large files/dirs Vercel doesn't need.
#
# NOTE: never ignore asset extensions (*.png, *.svg, etc.) here. A previous
# version ignored *.png and *.svg, which silently stripped every png/svg from
# apps/web/public/images — the production logo, testimonial quote icon, and
# all banner/hero art 404'd while jpgs kept serving. See .gitattributes-free
# verification: git ls-files 'apps/web/public/images/*.png' | wc -l > 0.
node_modules
apps/api
infra
supabase
marketing
docs
Design MD files
Trezo
logos
tools
.git
.github
*.pdf
